3. External corpus and trained model restrictions
------------------------------------------------

The Write & Improve Corpus 2024 and any other external datasets referenced by
this repository are not included in this license. They remain governed by
their own terms from their respective providers.

In particular, materials in this repository document use of the Write &
Improve Corpus 2024 from Cambridge University Press & Assessment. You are
responsible for obtaining that corpus yourself and complying with its terms.
Based on the restrictions documented in this repository:

- the corpus may not be redistributed in this repository or elsewhere;
- the corpus may not be used for commercial products;
- model checkpoints or weights trained on the corpus may not be redistributed;
- model checkpoints or weights trained on the corpus may not be used in a
